# ============================================================
# MP-CARE — minimal public repository: code + tests + configs only.
# Private docs, the manuscript, and bulky datasets are NOT pushed.
#   - Private documentation (submission strategy, reports, notes) -> Zenodo handles data
#   - Manuscript (paper/) is submitted to Elsevier directly, not via git
#   - Datasets are deposited on Zenodo (DOI cited in the paper)
# ============================================================

